        sol: { ja: "1,750＝100×(1+g)/(0.08−g)\n1,750×(0.08−g)＝100(1+g)\n140−1,750g＝100＋100g\n40＝1,850g\ng＝40/1,850＝0.0216\n答え: 約2.2%", en: "1,750 = 100×(1+g)/(0.08−g)\n1,750(0.08−g) = 100(1+g)\n140 − 1,750g = 100 + 100g\n40 = 1,850g\ng = 40/1,850 = 0.0216\nAnswer: ~2.2%" },
