      q: { ja: "買収EV 500、負債400・エクイティ100で取得。5年後にEBITDAは横ばい・EV倍率も横ばいでEVは500のまま。純負債を150まで返済した。エクイティ価値は？", en: "Acquired at EV 500 with 400 debt / 100 equity. After 5 years EBITDA and multiple are flat so EV stays 500. Net debt paid down to 150. Equity value?" },
      sol: { ja: "エクイティ=EV−純負債=500−150=350。\\n投下100→350なのでMOIC=3.5x。\\nEV横ばいでもデレバレッジ(400→150)だけで価値が3.5倍。", en: "Equity = EV − net debt = 500 − 150 = 350.\\nFrom 100 to 350 → MOIC = 3.5x.\\nDeleveraging alone (400→150) tripled equity with flat EV." },
