      sol: { ja: "1M→2M→4Mで倍増が2回。\\n単位コスト=100×0.8×0.8=64。\\n累積量4倍で単位コストは64まで低下＝低コスト優位の源泉。", en: "1M→2M→4M is two doublings.\\nUnit cost=100×0.8×0.8=64.\\nCost falls to 64 at 4× cumulative volume — a cost-advantage source." },
