      sol: { ja: "自社創出価値=150−90=60。競合=120−90=30。\\n差=+30は差別化（WTPの高さ）に由来。同コストで高WTP＝差別化優位。\\nこの余剰を価格と顧客余剰にどう配分するかが戦略。", en: "Own value created=150−90=60; rival=120−90=30.\\nThe +30 gap comes from higher WTP (differentiation) at equal cost.\\nStrategy is how to split this surplus between price and customer surplus." },
