      sol: { ja: "basket20超なので請求可能。\\ntipping basket（超過額のみ）なら90−20=70…capに達し70。\\ndeductible方式でも90−20=70でcap70に一致し70。\\n回収額=70（capで頭打ち）。", en: "Losses exceed the 20 basket, so claims are allowed.\\nAmount over the basket=90−20=70, which hits the cap.\\nRecoverable=70 (capped)." },
