      sol: { ja: "必要賛成=出席700×2/3≈466.7→467票以上。\\n定足数（過半数出席）は700>500で充足。\\n特別決議は467票以上で可決。", en: "Required=700×2/3≈466.7 → at least 467 votes.\\nQuorum (majority present) is met (700>500).\\nPasses with 467+ yes votes." },
