      sol: { ja: "交換比率=B株価/A株価=900/1500=0.6。\\nB社1株にA社株0.6株を交付。\\n（実務では市場価格に加えDCF等の複数手法で公正性を検討する）。", en: "Ratio=B/A=900/1500=0.6.\\nEach B share receives 0.6 A shares.\\n(In practice, fairness uses multiple methods beyond market price.)" },
